      <h3>Withdrawals</h3>
      <p>You can withdraw your $BEEP tokens at any time via the Cardano blockchain.</p>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <h4 class="panel-title">$BEEP Token Withdrawal (Cardano Blockchain)</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <ul>
            <li>Withdraw $BEEP tokens directly to your linked Cardano wallet</li>
            <li>Blockchain transactions are typically confirmed within minutes</li>
            <li>You must have a valid Cardano wallet address linked to your account</li>
            <li>Blockchain transaction fees (network fees) apply and are deducted from the withdrawal amount</li>
            <li>Once a blockchain transaction is confirmed, it cannot be reversed</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
