      <h3>Contest Entry Refunds</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>If a contest is cancelled before it begins, all entry fees will be refunded in full</li>
        <li>If a contest does not reach the minimum number of entries, it will be cancelled and entry fees refunded</li>
        <li>Once a contest has started (games are in progress), entry fees are non-refundable</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Bonus and Promotional Credits</h3>
      <p>In cases where a user has received a bonus or other promotional $BEEP token benefits and has not yet played through them (entering contests whose total entry fees equal the value of the bonus), SportsBeep reserves the right to refuse the withdrawal and/or close the user's account.</p>

      <h3>Anti-Fraud</h3>
      <p>SportsBeep conducts anti-fraud checks on playing patterns and deposits prior to processing withdrawals. We reserve the right to delay or deny withdrawals if suspicious activity is detected.</p>

